                "TASK-004"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "TASK-008",
            "title": "Implement the AI Prompt Builder and API Service",
            "description": "Create prompt.js containing the required buildPrompt(project) function. Integrate the supplied prompt from the resources without modifying its content, replacing only the designated bracketed values with the corresponding validated project information through a template literal. Create api.js to handle communication with the configured AI API endpoint. Retrieve the API key from sessionStorage, send the generated prompt using the required request format and return the API response to the application without directly manipulating the DOM.",
            "userStories": [
                "As a user, I want my project information to be converted into the required AI prompt so that the AI can generate a development plan based on my actual constraints.",
                "As a developer, I want API communication isolated in its own module so that network requests can be maintained independently of the interface."
            ],
            "acceptanceCriteria": [
                "prompt.js exports a named buildPrompt(project) function.",
                "The supplied prompt content is integrated without changing its original instructions.",
                "All designated project placeholders are replaced with the corresponding form values.",
                "The function returns the complete prompt as a string.",
                "api.js exports a named function responsible for sending the AI request.",
                "The request retrieves the API key from sessionStorage rather than localStorage.",
                "The request uses the configured API endpoint and expected request format.",
                "The API response or a descriptive error is returned to the calling application.",
                "api.js and prompt.js do not manipulate the DOM."
            ],
            "priority": "Critical",
            "importance": "High",
            "size": "S",
            "estimatedTime": 3,
            "deadline": "Day 4",
            "status": "To Do",
            "dependencies": [
                "TASK-004",
                "TASK-005"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "TASK-009",
            "title": "Parse and Validate the AI-Generated Development Plan",
            "description": "Implement a dedicated validation process that converts the AI response into a structured task array before it can be displayed or saved. Parse the response as JSON, verify the project task schema and required properties, check data types and allowed enum values, and validate task IDs and dependencies. Confirm that each dependency references an existing task, that dependency relationships are not circular and that every deadline falls within the project's duration. Reject malformed or incomplete plans with a useful validation error instead of displaying raw AI output.",
            "userStories": [
                "As a user, I want generated plans to be checked before they are added to my project so that I can work with reliable and consistent task data.",
                "As a developer, I want invalid AI responses to be rejected safely so that malformed data cannot break the Task Board."
            ],
            "acceptanceCriteria": [
                "The response is parsed as JSON before being used by the application.",
                "Every task contains all required task model properties.",
                "Task IDs are unique within the generated project.",
                "Priority values are restricted to Low, Medium, High and Critical.",
                "Importance values are restricted to Low, Medium and High.",
                "Size values are restricted to XS, S, M, L and XL.",
                "Status values are restricted to To Do, In Progress and Done.",
                "estimatedTime is a valid non-negative number.",
                "Every dependency references an existing task ID and does not reference the task itself.",
                "Circular dependency relationships are rejected.",
                "Deadlines use the expected Day N format and do not exceed the project duration.",
                "Invalid AI output produces a descriptive validation error and is never rendered directly.",
                "Valid task data is returned in the application's expected data structure."
            ],
            "priority": "Critical",
            "importance": "High",
            "size": "S",
            "estimatedTime": 3,
            "deadline": "Day 5",
            "status": "To Do",
            "dependencies": [
                "TASK-002",
                "TASK-008"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "TASK-010",
            "title": "Integrate Project Generation and Generation Status Handling",
            "description": "Connect the validated project form, prompt builder, API service, response validator and persistence modules into one complete generation workflow. Implement the idle, loading, success and error states. Display a spinner during requests, disable the generation button to prevent duplicate submissions, save the valid generated project and redirect to its Task Board after success. On API or validation failure, display a clear message and provide a Retry action. Ensure loading state is always released, including when requests fail.",
            "userStories": [
                "As a user, I want to generate a development plan from my project brief so that I can start organizing the work immediately.",
                "As a user, I want to see the generation status and retry failed requests so that I understand what is happening and am not left with a blocked application."
            ],
            "acceptanceCriteria": [
                "The generation action is available only when the form is valid.",
                "The application constructs the prompt using buildPrompt(project).",
                "The API response passes through the plan validation process before it is saved.",
                "The idle state indicates that generation is ready.",
                "The loading state displays a spinner and disables the generation button.",
                "Multiple simultaneous submissions are prevented.",
                "The success state confirms successful generation and redirects to the correct Task Board.",
                "The error state displays a clear message and a working Retry action.",
                "API errors, invalid responses and validation errors are handled without crashing the page.",
                "The loading state is released after both successful and failed requests.",
                "The generated project and tasks are saved to persistent storage before navigation."
            ],
            "priority": "Critical",
            "importance": "High",
            "size": "S",
            "estimatedTime": 3,
