        {
            "id": "TASK-018",
            "title": "Prepare Deployment, Project Documentation and Final Verification",
            "description": "Prepare the application for submission. Organize the final project files, verify that all required resources are included and deploy or publish the application using a hosting solution compatible with static HTML, CSS and JavaScript modules. Document the project structure, local execution steps, API key configuration, demo mode, application features and important business rules. Perform a final smoke test on the deployed or submitted version and verify that the project meets the submission requirements and deadline.",
